# LL(1) Parser — complete design, requirement-by-requirement

**Validation status.** Everything below was written into a scratch copy of the pre-TODO baseline (`git show 1438e69:Parser/SyntacticParser.cpp`) at `/tmp/pd_adv/Parser/SyntacticParser.cpp` and actually built and run:

